Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,======================== CAPÍTULOS E ABERTURAS======================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Main-207+,chptr,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:51.05,Main-207+,chptr,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:48.03,Main-207+,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,======================== CAPÍTULOS E ABERTURAS======================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,==============================DIÁLOGO============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.43,0:02:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nunca pensei que poderia conhecer você!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"O-Oden"...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esse é o diário do meu pai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:12.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Contém todos os detalhes sobre sua grande vida e o mundo que ele experimentou!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Naquele dia, encontrei em o rio abaixo do Castelo de Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alguém no castelo deve ter evitado que queimasse...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senhor Oden...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Ele escreveu muito sobre você também. Você nasceu no navio do Barba Branca, certo?! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:35.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então você navegou no navio do Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:37.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E então você foi para o navio do Roger! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Mas, desde que eu era tão jovem,\NNão me lembro de muita coisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Barba Branca, Roger e Oden...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:53.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Todos disseram...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Todos disseram...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Todos disseram...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Todos disseram...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:53.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Todos disseram...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,que vinte anos no futuro,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:06.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o Novo Mundo certamente seria invadido\Npor piratas jovens e poderosos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esse futuro é agora!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu tinha certeza que Ace seria\Nentre eles, liderando o grupo...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas quando ele morreu, me lembrei de algo daquela noite!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu deixei escapar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu não deveria dizer isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Você não ouviu isso! Esqueça isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:38.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E não se atreva a rir também!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo e eu não vamos tolerar isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso é o fim...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,do sonho do meu irmão mais novo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:54.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Claro, nós rimos quando Luffy nos disse, mas tudo bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:58.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somos os únicos que podem rir...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,porque acreditamos nele!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós realmente achamos que ele pode fazer isso, então–
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que há de errado, Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou rir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:20.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Essas foram as palavras exatas do Rei dos Piratas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.74,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,As mesmas palavras que surpreenderam Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No diário de Kozuki Oden, havia\Num grande homem que disse a mesma coisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu nunca riria disso!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seu irmão é incrível!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um grande homem, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:38.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que bom saber!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talvez Luffy e eu possamos pegar uma bebida com ele algum dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tenho certeza de que vocês se dariam bem!  
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas ele já está morto. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele é?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bem, nesse caso, seria difícil vê-lo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Está feito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Este é o seu cartão vivre!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É apenas um pouco de papel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sim!\NMas este pedaço de papel vai\Nnos reúna novamente um dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dê um pedaço para quem você quiser\Npara acompanhar ou nos encontrar novamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Com certeza farei isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:03.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós nos encontraremos novamente um dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pode apostar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Na realidade...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,essa seria nossa reunião final.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:40.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Eu não tinha ideia do que estava acontecendo\Nno mundo exterior naquele dia,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,mas li sobre isso no jornal mais tarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:49.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu descobri que Ace era filho de\No Rei dos Piratas, Gol D. Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, e que seu irmão mais novo\Nrealmente fez seu nome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esse foi o homem que você trouxe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:06:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devolvo isso para você, é claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isto é o que Oden escreveu sobre o futuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:23.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Daqui\Na vinte anos,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:35.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,um grupo\Nde jovens e poderosos piratas iniciará uma nova era no Novo Mundo! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:39.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Se eu morrer antes disso...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:39.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Se eu morrer antes disso...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:39.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Se eu morrer antes disso...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,eles serão os únicos...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:49.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,para derrubar Kaido!\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E aqui está outro...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que tal você sentar e ver como é feito?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu recuso!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:55.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,O mesmo aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tantas cabeças prontas para serem capturadas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chapéu de Palha...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Linlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você quer adivinhar o que esse pirralho disse que estaria, bem na minha cara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele com certeza é atrevido...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:31.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele também falou um grande jogo para mim!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele até destruiu meu castelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:38.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acredito que você me deve desculpas, Chapéu de Palha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, punk...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diga-nos novamente o que você disse que seria...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diga isso na nossa cara!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Você está bem, Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sinto muito...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demorei muito.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Estou... envergonhado...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Infelizmente...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,quando eu falecer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não terei nada para mostrar\NLord Oden, mas minha vergonha! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'e-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você poderia carregar...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano nas suas costas?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu imploro–
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiota!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Claro que vou!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É o país dos meus amigos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, pirralho!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:08.17,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Senhor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:10.09,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:13.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Estamos todos dentro...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,sua dívida...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trall!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mande todos eles para baixo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Por que está tremendo de novo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:38.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Você chama isso de haki, mas em Wano nos\Nreferimos a ele como ryuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:40.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Significa "fluir".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:44.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Oden foi executado!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:48.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Pelo shogun de Wano e pelo pirata Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.34,0:10:48.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== Pelo shogun de Wano e pelo pirata Kaido!\N===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.34,0:10:48.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Pelo shogun de Wano e pelo pirata Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:48.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Pelo shogun de Wano e pelo pirata Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:48.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Pelo shogun de Wano e pelo pirata Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== Pelo shogun de Wano e pelo pirata Kaido!\N===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:51.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Raizo está seguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== Sir Raizo está seguro!\N===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:48.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Raizo está seguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:48.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Raizo está seguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:48.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== Raizo está seguro!\N===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós nunca venderíamos nossos amigos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== Nunca venderíamos nossos amigos!\N===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:53.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós nunca venderíamos nossos amigos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:53.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós nunca venderíamos nossos amigos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:53.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós nunca venderíamos nossos amigos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:53.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós nunca venderíamos nossos amigos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:10:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== Nunca venderíamos nossos amigos!\N===
